  acceptedAnswers:
  - Trisha Yearwood
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABThat's What I Like About You\xBB, de 1991,
    y llega hasta 2008."
  - "Se mueve dentro de country; \xABWalkaway Joe\xBB refleja una energ\xEDa media
    y un pulso cercano a 117 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABThe Song Remembers When\xBB y \xABWhere Your
    Road Leads\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABShe's In Love With The Boy\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABShe's In Love With The Boy - Single
    Version\xBB y \xABXXX's And OOO's (An American Girl)\xBB."
